#: ../../language/error_codes/E4176.md:1
msgid "E4176"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4176.md:3
msgid "Compiler diagnostic name: `invalid_lexmatch_target`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4176.md:5
msgid ""
"This diagnostic code was used for an invalid `lexmatch` target and is not"
" emitted by the current compiler. The current diagnostic is "
"[E4222](E4222.md)."
msgstr "此诊断码曾用于表示无效的 `lexmatch` 目标，当前编译器已不再发出该诊断。当前对应的诊断是 [E4222](E4222.md)。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4176.md:8
msgid ""
"`lexmatch` works on textual views. The target expression must have a type"
" that can be matched by regex patterns, such as `String` or `StringView`,"
" instead of a numeric, boolean, or other unrelated type."
msgstr ""
"`lexmatch` 作用于文本视图。目标表达式的类型必须可以被正则模式匹配，例如 `String` 或 "
"`StringView`，而不能是数值、布尔值或其他无关类型。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4176.md:12
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4176.md:14
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn match_number(n : Int) -> Unit {\n"
"  lexmatch n with longest {\n"
"    _ => ()\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4176.md:18
msgid "The target is an `Int`, which cannot be consumed by `lexmatch`."
msgstr "目标是 `Int`，不能被 `lexmatch` 消费。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4176.md:20
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "修改建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4176.md:22
msgid "Match a `String` or `StringView`, or convert the input before matching."
msgstr "请匹配 `String` 或 `StringView`，或者在匹配前转换输入。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4176.md:24
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn match_text(text : String) -> Unit {\n"
"  lexmatch text with longest {\n"
"    _ => ()\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
